        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2PjJAca0_SJbN8KdMduQ-25" value="User login via SPIP Keycloack&lt;div&gt;User will have access to attributes and keys configured for his organizaton&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;User can select an encryption policy and request documents to be encrypted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;User can reqeust documents to be decrypted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Document Management solution to be deployed in each organization environemnt however should support multi tenenancy. In the first pahse we will deploy a single instange. To support multitenancy proposal is document storage to make sure buckets are created and retruned to user based on organization id which will be added as prefix to bucket name. Also for security reason the worker queues will not be displayed to end users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" y="100" width="410" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
